OL,3,AAnthropic warns of 'catastrophic risk'
OL,4,Ato humankind ahead of blockbuster share
OL,5,Alisting
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic has warned artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) could pose
OL,9,F"catastrophic or existential risks to
OL,10,Fhumanity" as it unveiled details of its
OL,11,Fplanned blockbuster stock market
OL,12,Flisting in the US.
OL,14,FThe firm's valuation is expected to
OL,15,Fexceed that of SpaceX, which was the
OL,16,Fbiggest-ever listing at an initial
OL,17,Fvaluation of about $1.8 trillion in the
OL,18,Fsummer.
OL,20,FAnthropic has not yet disclosed the
OL,21,Fnumber of shares to be released, their
OL,22,Fprice range, or a date for the listing.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
