OL,3,AUnnamed celebrity accused of
OL,4,A'inappropriate sexual activities',
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey told the court that his drastic
OL,8,Freaction was not because of any
OL,9,Fwrongdoing, but because of the fear of
OL,10,F"trial by media".
OL,12,FThe man denies abusing "his power and
OL,13,Fposition as a celebrity to contact and
OL,14,Fforge relationships with young women
OL,15,Fand teenagers to try to have sex with
OL,16,Fthem", the court heard.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
